                <p>
                    1. <strong>Execution Architecture & Direct STP Liquidity:</strong> Mainstreet Capital Exchange operates institutional straight-through processing (STP) with low-latency execution bridges into multi-bank, non-bank, and decentralized liquidity providers. Fractional shares, dividend accruals, and digital asset yields are subject to counterparty protocols and market liquidity depth.
                </p>
                <p>
                    2. <strong>High-Risk Investment Warning:</strong> Trading Contracts for Difference (CFDs), foreign exchange currencies, structured equities, and leveraged digital assets carries a high level of capital risk and may not be suitable for all investors. Leverage can magnify losses as well as gains. Before trading, please ensure you fully understand the risks involved, consider your investment objectives and experience level, and seek independent financial advice if necessary. Past performance of automated trading algorithms, quantitative baskets, or copy-trading strategies is not indicative of future results.
                </p>
                <p>
                    3. <strong>Regulatory Notice & Regional Restrictions:</strong> Mainstreet Capital Exchange Inc. provides technology and execution routing services in accordance with applicable financial standards. Services are not directed to residents of jurisdictions where the distribution or use of financial services violates local legal or regulatory requirements.
